Package: Slides26RodoALInterview
Title: Slides for the 2026 Assistant Lecturer Interview
Version: 0.2.0-1
Authors@R: person("Miguel", "Rodo", , "miguel.rodo@uct.ac.za", role =
        c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Miguel Rodo <miguel.rodo@uct.ac.za>
Description: Teaching-demonstration slides introducing multiple linear
        regression, for the 2026 assistant lecturer interview in the
        Department of Statistical Sciences, University of Cape Town.
        The slides follow on from simple linear regression in STA1000
        and use simulated advertising data.
